### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FournisseursController — /api/fournisseurs
### SEN PharmaFlow — compatible VS Code "REST Client" (Huachao)
### Fichier autonome : contient ses propres logins.
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@password = Password123!
@fournisseurPharmaSenegalId = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@fournisseurMedSupplyId = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@fournisseurAncienId = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004


### 0a. Login — ADMIN_PNA
# @name loginAdminPna
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cheikh.ba@sante.gouv.sn",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 0b. Login — GESTIONNAIRE_PNA
# @name loginGestionnairePna
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mamadou.diallo@sante.gouv.sn",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 0c. Login — PHARMACIEN_PNA (lecture seule attendue)
